        "html": "=<div style=\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #e5e7eb; padding: 40px 20px; color: #333333; line-height: 1.6;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 550px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); border: 1px solid #d1d5db;\">\n    \n    <div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #1d4ed8); padding: 35px 30px; color: #ffffff;\">\n      <span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: #93c5fd; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n        {{ $json.empresa }}\n      </span>\n      <h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.5px;\">\n        Seu holerite está disponível\n      </h2>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"padding: 35px 30px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin-top: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #1f2937;\">\n        Olá, <strong style=\"color: #111827;\">{{ $json.nome }}</strong>,\n      </p>\n      \n      <p style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #4b5563; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n        O documento referente ao <strong>{{ $json.data }}</strong> foi processado e já está pronto para visualização.\n      </p>\n\n      <div style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 4px solid #2563eb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 4px 8px 8px 4px; margin-bottom: 25px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03); border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"color: #6b7280; padding-bottom: 8px; width: 35%;\">Empresa:</td>\n            <td style=\"color: #111827; font-weight: 600; padding-bottom: 8px;\">{{ $json.empresa }}</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"color: #6b7280;\">Competência:</td>\n            <td style=\"color: #111827; font-weight: 600;\">{{ $json.data }}</td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"border: 1px dashed #cbd5e1; border-radius: 8px; padding: 15px; text-align: center; background-color: #fafafa; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n        <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #374151; font-weight: 500;\">\n          📎 O arquivo oficial segue anexado em formato <strong>PDF</strong>\n        </span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"background-color: #fffbeb; border: 1px solid #fef3c7; padding: 12px 15px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 13px; color: #b45309;\">\n        <strong>Aviso de Segurança (LGPD):</strong> Este documento contém dados sensíveis. Recomendamos não compartilhar o arquivo com terceiros.\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"background-color: #f8fafc; padding: 20px 30px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; text-align: center;\">\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;\">\n        Ref-ID: {{ $json.idguid }}\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>",
